  "question": "Which hotel can I find within 30 kilometers while moving from Battle of the Bulge Memorial, VA toward Rollins Avenue Park, Capitol Heights, MD?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.075579 38.874957)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-76.902678 38.878173)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'hotel'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.075579 38.874957)',4326)::geography, 30000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.075579 38.874957)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
